      "language": "zh",
      "level": "HSK 3",
      "text": "画蛇添足",
      "reading": "huà shé tiān zú",
      "meaning": "draw a snake and add feet",
      "literalMeaning": "To spoil something by adding unnecessary details.",
      "whenToUse": "Said when an extra action makes a good result worse.",
